# Patterns excluded from `music-shuffle`, one PCRE2 regex per line.
#
# MPD matches these case-insensitively against every tag (`any`) and against
# the file path relative to the music directory (`file`), so a line covers
# both album tags and directory names. Keep patterns specific enough not to
# swallow normal songs: `\bost\b` does not match "Ghost", for example.
#
# The library lives at /mnt/library/Music. Add one pattern per line, then run
# `music-shuffle` again (or press S in rmpc).

soundtrack
original motion picture
motion picture score
\bscore\b
